  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial contribution to help the people of Morocco affected by the earthquake</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Finan&#x10d;n&#xfd; pr&#xed;spevok na pomoc obyvate&#x13e;om Maroka zasiahnut&#xfd;ch zemetrasen&#xed;m</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Cie&#x13e;om je zabezpe&#x10d;enie materi&#xe1;lnej humanit&#xe1;rnej pomoci pre zasiahnut&#xe9; obyvate&#x13e;stvo v n&#xfa;dzi. Ide o komplexn&#xfa; pomoc v pre&#x17e;it&#xed; zimy formou n&#xe1;kupu a distrib&#xfa;cie stanov, ohrieva&#x10d;ov, gener&#xe1;torov, sol&#xe1;rnych panelov a tepl&#xe9;ho oble&#x10d;enia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to provide material humanitarian aid to the affected populations in need. This is a comprehensive help in surviving the winter in the form of purchase and distribution of tents, heaters, generators, solar panels and warm clothes.</narrative>
  </description>
